// Ch8 B06 "The binding of Virel" (act1_ch08.md §2 B06; F06 → F07 → fade). Letterboxed, scripted.
// F06: Asha goes into the crown chamber alone, by rite, as at the Shell Shrine. The others wait on the
// crown stair, where the noise of the beacon is. F07: a single held frame of Virel, a long
// ribbon-serpent of sailcloth panels coiled the height of the chamber, fire along every seam, PERFECTLY
// STILL (N-05, color rule 2), a brass tuning key at its throat. At rest the seams read as steady
// glimmer_bound, never flickering: no live flame here (fire is her battle VFX). Cut on a short fade,
// never a blend. No face beyond F07's frame (save it for the summon). Virel does not speak.
// Asha comes out with the third verse and the third band on her sleeve. She does NOT sing it (rule 5).
// No released light lifts off her this time (Ilun's weight stays with Ch3). Cut short by B07.
// Sets ch08_virel_bound (vowbound.json bound_flag; the sleeve's band 3).
title: ch08_binding
location: ch08/coilspire
---
@letterbox on
@camera F06
@mark asha crown_door walk via=way_f4_1,way_f4_2,way_f4_3,way_f4_4,way_f4_5,way_f4_6,way_f4_7,way_f4_8,way_f4_9,way_f4_10
@wait 1.5
@fade out 0.4
@camera F07
@vfx glimmer_bound at=virel_coil
@fade in 0.4
@music virel_bound
@wait 3.0
@fade out 0.6
<<set $ch08_virel_bound = true>>
@mark virel virel_gone
@mark asha crown_out
@camera F06_out
@fade in 0.8
@wait 1.0
Asha [exhausted]: She's very warm. #line:ch08_binding_001
@face asha soft_smile 0.6
Asha [soft_smile]: I think she was a kind person. Somewhere under all that fire. #line:ch08_binding_002
@wait 0.8
@letterbox off
===
